&lt;h2 id="简介"&gt;简介&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 id="章节列表"&gt;章节列表&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/1" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第一章“未上线游戏副本《半截玫瑰》官测进行中——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/2" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二章“请允许我们在这么好的氛围下——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/3" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三章“肩膀肌肉线条流畅，极具爆发力的美感——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/4" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第四章“他伸出指尖，带着玩弄意味的摩挲着男人的龟头——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/5" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第五章“几滴精液被他来不及合上的嘴含了进去——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/6" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第六章“腰肢劲瘦，浅浅的腰窝看的闻惊忱眼睛发红——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/7" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第七章“在登出游戏的那一刻时，你的身体会在外面潮吹吧——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/8" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第八章“腰腹疯狂挺胯，粗大的性器快速的在他的屁股里抽插——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/9" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第九章“牙齿轻磨了几下，带着点恼羞成怒的意味——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/10" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十章“他的模样，像是古老书章里被禁止提起的话题——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/11" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十一章“伏在他的耳边告诉他专属于这个世界的真相——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/12" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十二章“他偏头鼻息重重的吹在了青年敏感的脖颈上——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/13" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十三章“闻惊忱缓慢的挺腰，性器破开了许旧棠娇嫩的屁股——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/14" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十四章“许旧棠抬起头轻轻的吻了闻惊忱的嘴角——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/15" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;番外1“青年勾着他的腰，轻咬着唇也抑制不住呜咽出声——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/16" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;番外2“在看见许旧棠泛着红的耳尖时，轻声一笑——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/17" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;番外3“撅起来自己白嫩又充满了肉感的大屁股——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/18" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;番外4“那一场性爱就像是傅闻自己做的一个梦——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/19" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;番外5“他不管了，扶着岑屿生的肉棒直接整根吃了进去——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/20" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;番外6“既然哥哥要找情人的话，为什么不能是我呢——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/21" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;番外7“带着透亮的津液也沾满了那骨节分明的手指——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/22" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;番外8“他老婆明明一点错都没有好吗——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/23" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;番外8“让他能够更加深入的吞进他胯下的巨物——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/24" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;番外10“水渍被卷上了舌尖，带进了溢出清冷香气的唇齿——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/25" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;番外11“龟头顶到许旧棠的最深处总会给他带来阵阵的战栗——”&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1d778b2d00a547aba7a0ac1bffa3406a/reader/26" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;番外12“他恍惚的听见了男人清冷又带着满腔的爱意对着他说——”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>